fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"codecparsers/gstav1parser.html#gst_av1_parser_free","fragment":"\n\tgst_av1_parser_free\n\n\n\tGstCodecParsers.AV1Parser.prototype.free\n\n\n\tGstCodecParsers.AV1Parser.free\n\nIf parser is not NULL, frees its allocated memory.\nIt cannot be used afterwards.\nParameters:\nthe GstAV1Parser to free\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.18\n\t\t\nIf parser is not null, frees its allocated memory.\nIt cannot be used afterwards.\nParameters:\nthe GstCodecParsers.AV1Parser to free\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.18\n\t\t\nIf parser is not None, frees its allocated memory.\nIt cannot be used afterwards.\nParameters:\nthe GstCodecParsers.AV1Parser to free\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.18\n\t\t\n"});